OL,3,GNEWSAGrave of Cornish WW2 soldier found
OL,4,Ain Germany
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grave of a World War Two soldier from
OL,7,FCornwall, missing since 1945, has been
OL,8,Fidentified in Germany.
OL,10,FThe Ministry of Defence (MoD) said the
OL,11,Fpreviously unnamed grave had been
OL,12,Frededicated to Private Sidney Allen,
OL,13,Fborn in St Germans, 81 years after his
OL,14,Fdeath.
OL,16,FA service for Allen, who served in
OL,17,FHampshire Regiment, was organised by
OL,18,Fthe MOD's war detectives at CWGC
OL,19,FReichswald Forest War Cemetery, north
OL,20,Fof Essen.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
