OL,3,GNEWSAGrave of Cornish WW2 soldier found
OL,4,Ain Germany
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government's Joint Casualty and
OL,7,FCompassionate Centre (JCCC) caseworker
OL,8,FNicola Nash said: "Today we remember
OL,9,Fhis sacrifice and ensure that his name,
OL,10,Fservice and story are never forgotten."
